`GET /api/stocks?on_date=2026-10-03`

**200 OK**

```json
{
  "on_date": "2026-10-03",
  "medicines": [
    {
      "medicine_id": 101,
      "code": "OBT-001",
      "name": "Paracetamol 500 mg tablet",
      "unit": "tablet",
      "physical_quantity": 104,
      "available_quantity": 96,
      "expired_quantity": 8,
      "batches": [
        {"batch_no": "PCT-2601", "expires_on": "2027-12-31", "quantity": 94, "is_expired": false},
        {"batch_no": "PCT-2501", "expires_on": "2026-09-30", "quantity": 8, "is_expired": true}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

`physical_quantity` = available + expired; batch dikirim sebagai satu daftar `batches` ber-flag `is_expired`; tepat pada tanggal kedaluwarsa masih tersedia.

`GET /api/references/suppliers`

**200 OK**

```json
{
  "data": [
    {"id": 1, "name": "Farma Nusantara"},
    {"id": 2, "name": "Medika Sentosa"}
  ]
}
```

Pemasok `is_active = 0` (id 3) tidak ikut. **401** `{"message":"Belum masuk."}` tanpa sesi.

`GET /api/references/medicines`

**200 OK**

```json
{
  "data": [
    {"id": 101, "name": "Paracetamol 500 mg tablet", "unit": "tablet"},
    {"id": 102, "name": "Amoxicillin 500 mg kapsul", "unit": "kapsul"}
  ]
}
```

Obat `is_active = 0` (105, 124, 125) tidak ikut. **401** tanpa sesi.

`GET /api/references/batches`

**200 OK**

```json
{
  "data": [
    {"medicine_id": 101, "batch_no": "PCT-2501", "expires_on": "2026-09-30"},
    {"medicine_id": 101, "batch_no": "PCT-2601", "expires_on": "2027-12-31"}
  ]
}
```

Daftar batch unik dari ledger `stock_movements` (`MAX(expires_on)` per `medicine_id` + `batch_no`), saran kolom Batch No pada form penerimaan; batch baru tetap boleh diketik. **401** tanpa sesi.

`GET /api/medicines` — petugas punya `medicine.view`, jadi 200.

**200 OK**

```json
{
  "data": [
    {"id": 101, "code": "OBT-001", "name": "Paracetamol 500 mg tablet", "unit": "tablet", "is_active": true},
    {"id": 105, "code": "OBT-005", "name": "Obat nonaktif contoh", "unit": "tablet", "is_active": false}
  ],
  "can_write": false
}
```

Query opsional: `?q=` (LIKE pada `code`/`name`, wildcard `%`/`_` pengguna di-escape jadi literal), `?status=all|active|inactive` (default `all`). Urutan: `name ASC`, `id ASC`. `can_write` = hak aktor saat ini (untuk menyembunyikan tombol tulis di UI; penegakan tetap di server).

**422** bila `status` di luar nilai yang diizinkan:

```json
{"message": "status harus salah satu dari all, active, inactive."}
```

`POST /api/medicines` — supervisor membuat obat uji; `{{medicine_code}}` diisi otomatis oleh test script (unik per run).

**Body**

```json
{"code": "{{medicine_code}}", "name": "Obat uji master", "unit": "tablet", "is_active": true}
```

**201 Created**

```json
{
  "message": "Obat dibuat.",
  "data": {"id": 126, "code": "OBT-RAND-XXXX", "name": "Obat uji master", "unit": "tablet", "is_active": true}
}
```

Pembuatan menulis log audit `CREATE` (`entity_type = "medicine"`) dalam transaksi. **422** bila `code` sudah dipakai; **500** bila gagal simpan (rollback).

`GET /api/medicines/{{medicine_id}}` — riwayat aksi obat uji dari item 4.6 yang dinonaktifkan item 4.7.

**200 OK**

```json
{
  "data": {
    "id": 126, "code": "OBT-RAND-XXXX", "name": "Obat uji master", "unit": "tablet", "is_active": false,
    "logs": [
      {"id": 1, "actor_id": 1, "actor_name": "Rina Supervisor", "action": "Audit.medicines.action.create", "data_before": null, "data_after": {"is_active": 1}, "created_at": "2026-10-07 10:00:00"},
      {"id": 2, "actor_id": 1, "actor_name": "Rina Supervisor", "action": "Audit.medicines.action.update", "data_before": {"is_active": true}, "data_after": {"is_active": false}, "created_at": "2026-10-07 10:05:00"}
    ]
  },
  "can_write": false
}
```

`data.logs` berisi baris `audit_logs` (`entity_type = "medicine"`) urut kronologis; `data_before` bernilai `null` untuk aksi create. Riwayat hanya disertakan di **detail** — daftar (`GET /api/medicines`) sengaja tetap ramping. **404** bila id tidak ada.
